WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:07.950
When you're looking at the Sagittarius constellation
you're actually looking into the center of

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:13.589
our galaxy.

00:00:13.589 --> 00:00:18.880
Steve Carell never watched more than 10 minutes
of the original Office, for fear of copying

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:20.940
Rickey Gervais' character.

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:27.320
In 1963, baseball pitcher Gaylord Perry remarked,
'They'll put a man on the moon before I hit

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:28.520
a home run.'

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:35.379
On July 20, 1969, less than an hour after
Neil Armstrong had set foot on the moon, Gaylord

00:00:35.379 --> 00:00:39.289
Perry hit his first home run.

00:00:39.289 --> 00:00:44.100
Bugs Bunny was the second cartoon character
to receive a star on the Hollywood Walk of

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.460
Fame; the first was Mickey Mouse.

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:53.370
A troop of 15 monkeys escaped a primate research
centre in Japan by using trees as catapults

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:56.329
over a 5-metre high electric fence.

00:00:56.329 --> 00:00:59.600
They were lured back afterwards with peanuts.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:04.680
In the 16th century, gin was referred to as
“mother's ruin” because people thought

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:06.930
it could induce an abortion.

00:01:06.930 --> 00:01:11.500
A restaurant in Grantham, England makes the
world's hottest curry.

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:18.300
Called “The Widower”, it contains 20 Naga
Infinity Chillis and chefs have to wear goggles

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:19.700
to prepare it.

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:25.580
300 people have failed to eat the dish, most
leave crying, shaking and vomiting.

00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:32.110
Only one person has ever finished the entire
dish, a doctor who took 1 hour to eat it and

00:01:32.110 --> 00:01:36.750
spent 10 full minutes hallucinating due to
the chilis.

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:42.750
Michael Crichton, author of Jurassic Park,
felt his professor was giving him unfair grades.

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:48.610
To prove it he turned in a paper by George
Orwell and received a B-.

00:01:48.610 --> 00:01:53.970
There is one lawyer for every 19 residents
in Washington DC.

00:01:53.970 --> 00:02:01.490
About 75% of the world's food is generated
from only 12 plants and 5 animal species.

00:02:01.490 --> 00:02:06.960
In order to legally adopt a child from Korea,
the adopting parents cannot have a BMI of

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:09.910
more than 35.

00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:15.150
In Japan a few foreign cartoons have been
edited including “Bob The Builder”, to

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:18.110
add a fifth finger to the character's hands.

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:23.120
The reason is that having only four fingers
in Japan implies one is part of the Japanese

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:24.280
mafia.

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:25.310
J.R.R.

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:32.639
Tolkien taught himself Finnish at 18, just
so he could read one book, the Kalevala, which

00:02:32.639 --> 00:02:35.990
he used as a basis for Middle Earth legendarium.

00:02:35.990 --> 00:02:43.629
In 2017, Norway will be the first country
in the world to completely shut down FM radio

00:02:43.629 --> 00:02:44.879
and go digital.

00:02:44.879 --> 00:02:51.040
Norway plans to switch to DAB since FM radio
is eight times more expensive.

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:58.939
During WWII, La-Z-Boy manufactured seats for
tanks, torpedo boats, gun turrets, and armoured

00:02:58.939 --> 00:02:59.939
cars.

00:02:59.939 --> 00:03:05.879
In 2009, a man named Felix Batista, who was
an expert on how to avoid being kidnapped

00:03:05.879 --> 00:03:24.060
in Mexico was kidnapped in Mexico after giving
a lecture on “How to not be kidnapped 

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:51.559
in Mexico”.

